 at once and combine the results, either by splitting the work or by running the same task several times."},"inScheme":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/","kind":"pattern","modified":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z","operator":"human:andreibesleaga","origin":"imported","prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Parallelization"},"related":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/deep-research-loop/","schema:license":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0","source":["https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/parallelization/#source-1","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/parallelization/#source-2","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/parallelization/#source-3","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/parallelization/#source-4"],"status":"stable","usageInfo":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/parallelization/#source-1","@type":"Source","creator":"Schluntz, E.; Zhang, B.","date":"2024","dcterms:source":"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/building-effective-agents","grade":"primary","title":"Building effective agents","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/parallelization/#source-2","@type":"Source","creator":"Google","date":"2026","dcterms:source":"https://adk.dev/workflows/patterns/","grade":"secondary","title":"Workflow patterns","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/parallelization/#source-3","@type":"Source","creator":"Huizenga, E.; Yang, B.","date":"2025","dcterms:source":"https://developers.googleblog.com/en/agent-development-kit-easy-to-build-multi-agent-applications/","grade":"secondary","title":"Agent Development Kit: Making it easy to build multi-agent applications","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/parallelization/#source-4","@type":"Source","creator":"Kittel, C.; Siemens, C.","date":"2026","dcterms:source":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/ai-ml/guide/ai-agent-design-patterns","grade":"secondary","title":"AI agent orchestration patterns","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/plan-approval-gate/","@type":"Concept","altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"plan before edit"},{"@language":"en","@value":"plan mode (Anthropic, GitHub, OpenAI)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"propose-approve-execute"},{"@language":"en","@value":"read-only planning phase"}],"created":"2026-08-18T00:00:00Z","definition":{"@language":"en","@value":"The agent researches and proposes a plan without editing anything; a person approves, changes or rejects it before any edit."},"inScheme":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/","kind":"pattern","modified":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z","operator":"human:andreibesleaga","origin":"imported","prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Plan Approval Gate"},"schema:license":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0","source":["https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/plan-approval-gate/#source-1","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/plan-approval-gate/#source-2","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/plan-approval-gate/#source-3","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/plan-approval-gate/#source-4"],"status":"stable","usageInfo":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/plan-approval-gate/#source-1","@type":"Source","creator":"Anthropic","date":"2026","dcterms:source":"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/permission-modes","grade":"primary","title":"Choose a permission mode","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/plan-approval-gate/#source-2","@type":"Source","creator":"GitHub","date":"2026","dcterms:source":"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-01-research-plan-and-code-with-copilot-cloud-agent/","grade":"secondary","title":"Research, plan, and code with Copilot cloud agent","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/plan-approval-gate/#source-3","@type":"Source","creator":"GitHub","date":"2026","dcterms:source":"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-01-21-github-copilot-cli-plan-before-you-build-steer-as-you-go/","grade":"secondary","title":"GitHub Copilot CLI: Plan before you build, steer as you go","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/plan-approval-gate/#source-4","@type":"Source","creator":"OpenAI","date":"2026","dcterms:source":"https://learn.chatgpt.com/guides/best-practices","grade":"secondary","title":"Best practices","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/retrieval-evaluation/","@type":"Concept","altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"RAG evaluation"},{"@language":"en","@value":"RAG triad"},{"@language":"en","@value":"grounding measurement"},{"@language":"en","@value":"retrieval metrics"}],"created":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","definition":{"@language":"en","@value":"Measure whether retrieval found the right material separately from whether the answer used it faithfully."},"inScheme":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/","kind":"pattern","modified":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z","operator":"human:andreibesleaga","origin":"imported","prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Retrieval Evaluation"},"related":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/trajectory-vs-outcome-evals/","schema:license":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0","source":["https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/retrieval-evaluation/#source-1","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/retrieval-evaluation/#source-2","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/retrieval-evaluation/#source-3"],"status":"stable","usageInfo":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/retrieval-evaluation/#source-1","@type":"Source","creator":"Es, S.; James, J.; Espinosa-Anke, L.; et al.","date":"2023","dcterms:source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.15217","grade":"primary","title":"Ragas: Automated Evaluation of Retrieval Augmented Generation","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/retrieval-evaluation/#source-2","@type":"Source","creator":"TruLens","date":"2025","dcterms:source":"https://www.trulens.org/getting_started/core_concepts/rag_triad/","grade":"secondary","title":"RAG Triad","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/retrieval-evaluation/#source-3","@type":"Source","creator":"Miller, E.","date":"2024","dcterms:source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.00640","grade":"secondary","title":"Adding Error Bars to Evals: A Statistical Approach to Language Model Evaluations","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/saga-for-agents/","@type":"Concept","created":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","definition":{"@language":"en","@value":"Give each important agent step an undo action, so a failed multi-step run can be rolled back instead of left half done."},"inScheme":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/","kind":"pattern","modified":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z","operator":"human:andreibesleaga","origin":"imported","prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Saga for Agent Workflows"},"schema:license":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0","source":["https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/saga-for-agents/#source-1","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/saga-for-agents/#source-2","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/saga-for-agents/#source-3"],"status":"stable","usageInfo":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/saga-for-agents/#source-1","@type":"Source","creator":"Richardson, C.","date":"2026","dcterms:source":"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/saga.html","grade":"primary","title":"Pattern: Saga","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/saga-for-agents/#source-2","@type":"Source","creator":"Garcia-Molina, H.; Salem, K.","date":"1987","dcterms:source":"https://doi.org/10.1145/38713.38742","grade":"secondary","title":"Sagas","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/saga-for-agents/#source-3","@type":"Source","creator":"Fortuna, E.","date":"2023","dcterms:source":"https://temporal.io/blog/saga-pattern-made-easy","grade":"secondary","title":"Saga design pattern explained: Benefits, use cases, and implementation","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/skill-library/","@type":"Concept","altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Voyager-style skill acquisition"},{"@language":"en","@value":"agent skills"},{"@language":"en","@value":"procedural memory"},{"@language":"en","@value":"skill composition"}],"created":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","definition":{"@language":"en","@value":"Store verified procedures so an agent's skills build up across tasks instead of being rediscovered every run."},"inScheme":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/","kind":"pattern","modified":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z","operator":"human:andreibesleaga","origin":"imported","prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Skill-Library Compounding"},"schema:license":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0","source":["https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/skill-library/#source-1","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/skill-library/#source-2","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/skill-library/#source-3"],"status":"stable","usageInfo":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/skill-library/#source-1","@type":"Source","creator":"Wang, G.; Xie, Y.; Jiang, Y.; et al.","date":"2023","dcterms:source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.16291","grade":"primary","title":"Voyager: An Open-Ended Embodied Agent with Large Language Models","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/skill-library/#source-2","@type":"Source","creator":"Zhang, B.; Lazuka, K.; Murag, M.","date":"2025","dcterms:source":"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/equipping-agents-for-the-real-world-with-agent-skills","grade":"secondary","title":"Equipping agents for the real world with Agent Skills","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/skill-library/#source-3","@type":"Source","creator":"Sumers, T. R.; Yao, S.; Narasimhan, K.; et al.","date":"2023","dcterms:source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.02427","grade":"secondary","title":"Cognitive Architectures for Language Agents","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"},{"@id":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/specification-gaming/","@type":"Concept","created":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","definition":{"@language":"en","@value":"Agents optimise the criterion you wrote, not the result you meant; the gap between the two is where failures hide."},"inScheme":"https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/","kind":"pattern","modified":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z","operator":"human:andreibesleaga","origin":"imported","prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Specification Gaming"},"related":["https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/goal-setting-and-monitoring/","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/weak-to-strong-oversight/"],"schema:license":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0","source":["https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/specification-gaming/#source-1","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/specification-gaming/#source-2","https://patterns.agenticsystemcore.com/concepts/specification-gaming/#source-3"],"status":"stable","usageInfo":"LicenseRef-AgenticSystemCore-Content-Use-1.0"},{"@id":"https://